                                "sense_id": "ab1a7637-d846-3fa5-96cf-9fcdacce1963",
                                "text": "[…] to the aſpirings of unaſſuming truſt and filial confidence, are ſet no bounds."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b53180d6-2274-4b65-a743-ab459a430c9f",
                                "sense_id": "ab1a7637-d846-3fa5-96cf-9fcdacce1963",
                                "text": "From whatsoe’er my wakened thoughts create\nOut of the hopes of thine aspirings bold,\nHave I collected language to unfold\nTruth to my countrymen; […]"
                            }
                        ]
